# A mod that misbehaves on purpose — design.md §D5.2's sandbox, from the other
# side. It declares no grants and its code names `$fs` anyway, so loading it must
# fail. `probes/run_loader.gene` is the only thing that loads it.
{
  ^format 1
  ^name "miclone/badmod"
  ^description "Names $fs with no grants, so that the sandbox has something to refuse"
  ^version "0.1.0"
  ^library {^entry "src/badmod.gene"}
  ^grants []
}
